      "note": [
        "Correction 2022-06-13. Sweden-based monetary financial institutions (MFIs) assets abroad have been corrected for the periods quarter 3 2019 to quarter 1 2022. The correction is conduced due to that the retrieval from Statistics Swedens survey Securities Holdings (VINN) had been implemented incorrectly. This means that the securities holdings for a few institutions have been miscalculated. The correction changes the monetary financial institutions securities holdings, included in the survey, with an average decrease of 19 percent. The average decrease for all monetary financial institutions assets included in the survey is 1.5 per cent."
      ],
